  abstract  = "Geometric realization of an opinion is considered as a simplex
               and the opinion space of a group of individuals is a simplicial
               complex whose topological features are monitored in the process
               of opinion formation. The agents are physically located at the
               nodes of a scale-free and a random network. Social interactions
               include all concepts of social dynamics present in the mainstream
