  volume    =  44,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "115--145",
  abstract  = "Encoding brain regions and their connections as a network of
               nodes and edges captures many of the possible paths along which
               information can be transmitted as humans process and perform
               complex behaviors. Because cognitive processes involve large,
               distributed networks of brain areas, principled examinations of
