               algebraic topology offer a novel perspective on structural
               connectomics, highlighting loop-like paths as crucial features in
               the human brain's structural architecture.",
  month     =  feb,
  year      =  2018,
  keywords  = "Applied topology; Network neuroscience; Persistent homology",
  language  = "en"
}

