               our article, we introduce a Riemannian batch normalization
               (batch- norm) algorithm, which generalizes the one used in
               Euclidean nets. This novel layer makes use of geometric
               operations on the manifold, notably the Riemannian barycenter,
               parallel transport and non-linear structured matrix
