               descent algorithm working in the space of SPD matrices, allowing
               to learn the batchnorm layer. We validate our proposed approach
               with experiments in three different contexts on diverse data
               types: a drone recognition dataset from radar observations, and
               on emotion and action recognition datasets from video and motion
               capture data. Experiments show that the Riemannian batchnorm
