                   produce the same output behavior, their internal
                   representations differ dramatically. The SGD-trained networks
                   exhibit a form of disorganization that we term fractured
                   entangled representation (FER). Interestingly, the evolved
                   networks largely lack FER, even approaching a unified
                   factored representation (UFR). In large models, FER may be
