  volume    =  01,
  number    =  01,
  pages     = "97--128",
  abstract  = "This study addresses a practical gap in English Language Teaching
               research, namely the lack of quantitative, case-grounded evidence
               on how large language models deliver personalized instruction at
               scale. The purpose is to model how LLM personalization and
               feedback translate into learner outcomes within real classrooms
