               data substantially improves its generalization. Most importantly,
               in a human evaluation study, feedback generated by the ARGUS
               system was rated as consistently and significantly more specific,
               accurate, actionable, and helpful than that from strong
               baselines, including a fine-tuned LLM and a zero-shot GPT-4. Our
               work demonstrates a robust systems engineering approach,
               grounding LLM-based feedback in GNN-driven structural analysis to
               create an intelligent teaching system that provides targeted,
               pedagogically valuable guidance for L2 student writers engaging
               with persuasive essays.",
  month     =  dec,
  year      =  2025,
  language  = "en"
}

