                   validating its effectiveness in generating truly
                   cognitive-aware and personalized concept recommendations
                   without relying on explicit structural priors.",
  month         =  nov,
  year          =  2025,
  archivePrefix = "arXiv",
  primaryClass  = "cs.IR"
}

@ARTICLE{Hu2024-fg,
  title         = "{FOKE}: A personalized and explainable education framework
